<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">Tutsa: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Philimoon</para>
  <para style="toc1">PHILIMOON suh Pool ih raang arah Le</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philimoon</para>
  <para style="toc3">Phm</para>
  <para style="mt1">PHILIMOON</para>
  <para style="mt2">Suh Pool Ih Raang Arah Le</para>
  <para style="imt">Ephangjatjih</para>
  <para style="ip">Philimoon ah wahak Kristaan mina mirep ih jat arah nyia Kolose chaaste angta, eno dah wasiit Onesimas ngeh ih angta erah warah changte ah Philimoon angta. Erah dah ah heh changte reenawa doksoon eta, enoothong Pool phaatak ni tongta adi Onesimas ah chowaanta. Onesimas ah Pool thoidi Kristaan ih hoonta. Pool ih Philemoon suh le raangmaat ha langla, heh dah ah damdoh toom hukse waan ah ngeh ih maat ha, tiimnge liidi heh dah ngeh ih luulu labanchoh thang ih Kristaan phoh ano ngeh ih nep toom banchoh ah ngeh ih thun ano Onesimas ah heh taang ni we ngaakwang thukla.</para>
  <para style="iot">Hemong Dowa Jatjih</para>
  <para style="io1">Ephangjatjih<char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:1-3">1-3</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Philemoon ah phoongphaata <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:4-7">4-7</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Onesimas suh raangkota<char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:8-22">8-22</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ethoondi<char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHM 1:23-25">23-25</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Jisu Kristo thoilam di phaatak ni tongte Pool nyia seng phono Timothi taangnawa—</para>
  <para style="p">Seng joonte seng damdi roong mootkaatte Philemoon suh, <verse number="2" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:17">Kol 4:17</ref></char></note>nyia an nok ni chomuiti chaaste loong suh nep, adoleh seng loong no Apphia nyia sipaahi Arkippus loong suh raanghang:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Seng loong Wah Rangte nyia Teesu Jisu Kristo ih minchan toom kohan nyia semroongroong toom songtong thuk han.</para>
  <para style="s">Philemoon minchan nyia heh tuumaang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nga no Philemoon, Rangte suh lakookmi li angno, an raangtaan ih saapoot rookwet rangsoom hang <verse number="5" style="v"/>Rangte mina loong raangtaan ih an minchan eje nyia Jisu su tuumaang lu ah ngah ih japchaat ehang. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nga rangsoom ah langla seng hanpiite loong ih sen damdi rangchosoom hi thoidoh Kristo jun ih romseetam tiit ah ehanhan toom ih jat ih. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nga no, an minchan tiit asuh ngah rapne roonlang nyia chaan koh halang! Rangte mina loong ten rapne ih roonthuk lu.</para>
  <para style="s">Onismas suh lasijoot le raangha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih, Kristo phoh ano jun ih, tiimjih reejih ah erah lacho laphaan ih jen baattaan etheng taha. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Enoothong an nga moongnook ang thoidi, an lasih ba johala. Ngah Pool laang ang ang bah uh, nyia Kristo mendi laang mokah ang bah uh adoleh amadi heh thoilam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amadi heh thoilam di phaatak ni laangtong ang bah uh</char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh</char><char style="fq" closed="false">teekaang di Kristo thoilam di phaatak ni tonglang.</char></note> di phaatak ni laangtong ang bah uh, an nga moongnook ang thoidi reelang. <verse number="10" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:9">Kol 4:9</ref> </char></note> Erah raangtaan Onesimas mendi an lasih johala, heh amadi Kristo mendi nga sah miimi eh hoonla; tiimnge liidi ngah phaatak ni tong angdi chiilam laalam ni heh wah eh hoon lang. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Pootsiit an raangtaan ih heh tiim uh tah angta, enoothong amadi heh sek raangtaan ih ejamjih<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Grik nok hah ih Onesimas ah “ekap ejih.” </char></note> eh hoonla.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Amadi heh an reeni ngaakwang thuk halang, ngaathung ngaatak uh heh damdi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ngah Ruurang Ese tungthoidi phaatak ni tonglang pootdoh, an ih chosok lakbi toom chosok hang ngeh ih nga reenah tongthuk thengtang. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ang abah uh, an ih ngah chosok jaatjaat etheng ngeh ih tali kang; heh thung ih toom re ah ngeh ih li hala. Erah raangtaan ih an thung lah angko bah ngah tiim uh tami reekang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Onismas ah pootsiit an reenawa haloh ih hoonta ah langla an reenah saarep raangtaan toom ngaak tongha ngeh ih heh ang thamta. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Eno amadi heh dah luulu tah angka, dah nang eju elong eh hoonla: Heh Kristo phoh ano eh hoonla. Nga raangtaan ih heh nga mongnook! Adoleh an raangtaan ih erah nang ih ju eseethoon ang ah, heh dah luulu lah angthang ih Teesu mendi phoh ano eh hoonla.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih, anjoon anwaan ngeh ih thun hang bah, ngah ban noppoon hang ah liikhiik heh uh ban noppoon ih uh. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Heh an raangtaan ih thetreeta bah nyia tiimkot jilam angta bah uh, ngah ih ngaak kottheng ngeh ih raangthiin uh. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Arah, nga teewah lak ih raangmaat halang: Ngah Pool, ngah ih ma ngaak koha. ( An nga raangtaan ih, an suh lah dopbaatjih angta.) <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nga no, erah raangtaan ih, Teesu mendoh nga jeng ah boichaat ih weeuh, Kristo phoh ano mendoh ngah eroon ih weethuk hang!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Arah le ah raangmaat hangno, ngah sen suh re erum ah ngeh ih kamkam ih laalom lang—ngah ih jat ih hang erah nang ih botseh ehan reeraang pakna an. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Erah damdoh, nga tong suh rumsiit than ban khookham thiin an, tiimnge liidi Rangte ih sen loong rangsoom ah chaat eha ngeh ih laalom lang eno sen reenah engaak ih thuk hang.</para>
  <para style="s">Jengse thoon raajeng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="COL 1:7">Kol 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:12">4:12</ref></char>
    </note> Jisu Kristo raangtaan ih, nga damdi phaatak ni roongtongte, Epaphras ih sen suh jengseera halan, <verse number="24" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">Esm 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:29">Esm 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4:10</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:10">2Tim 4:10</ref>,<ref loc="2TI 4:11">11</ref></char></note> erah damdi nga damdi roong mootkaatte Maak, Aritarkus, Demas nyia Luk loong ih nep jengseera halan.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Teesu Jisu Kristo minchan sen loongtang damdoh toom je ah.</para>
</usx>
